    "name": {
      "value": "Desert Tracker"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You're at home blazing trails in the burning sands, and you made a living guiding or following creatures in the desert. You might be a native nomad, an experienced desert guide, a naturalist, a bandit driven into the dunes by the law\u2014or all of the above.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Desert Lore skill. You gain the Experienced Tracker skill feat."
    },
